# One git patch filename per line, applied in order to .runtime/behavior (and
# .runtime/behavior-g1 and .runtime/behavior-dex). Ported from RoboEnv:
# 0001 OmniGibson's dataset-recording and LeRobot wrappers become optional imports and extras;
# 0002 OMNIGIBSON_RENDER_GPU selects Isaac's Vulkan renderer apart from the CUDA physics device.
# And rosbridge's own:
# 0003 BehaviorTask.get_goal_option_satisfaction (the evaluator's q_score) evaluates each distinct
#      grounded goal literal once; a quantified goal repeats them across many options.
# 0004 Macro particle systems update the physics handles once per batch of physical particles
#      added or removed, not per particle, and not for visual particles, which are in no physics view.
0001-optional-workflows.patch
0002-gpu-selection.patch
0003-goal-option-literals.patch
0004-particle-handle-updates.patch
